    "text": "IT is hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 that theGovernment intended to acquire the following land or servitudewhich is required for a public purpose.",
